                <mxCell id="s14box" value="14) KC processes SAML Response&#xa;• verifies signature against P1&#39;s signingCertificate&#xa;• extracts email, firmCd, roles claims&#xa;• first-broker-login auto-link by email&#xa;• creates / finds KC user&#xa;• starts KC SSO session (sets KEYCLOAK_IDENTITY)&#xa;• runs saml-role-idp-mappers → realm roles" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffdf0;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5" parent="1" vertex="1">
